    <div class="faq-list">

      <h3 class="faq-section-title">General Questions</h3>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-q">Is your activity legal?<div class="faq-toggle">+</div></div>
        <p class="faq-a">Yes, AuravexCapital operates as a legitimate investment platform. We comply with applicable regulations and maintain full transparency with our investors.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-q">How do I register an account?<div class="faq-toggle">+</div></div>
        <p class="faq-a">Click "Create Account" at the top of the site. Enter your full name, email address, and choose a password. Your account will be ready immediately after registration.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-q">Can I create multiple accounts?<div class="faq-toggle">+</div></div>
        <p class="faq-a">Each person should maintain one account. Multiple accounts sharing the same IP address from the same household are considered normal family usage and are permitted.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-q">Is the platform secure?<div class="faq-toggle">+</div></div>
        <p class="faq-a">AuravexCapital is equipped with advanced security options and protected by industry-standard encryption protocols, allowing you to invest and transact securely at all times.</p>
      </div>

      <h3 class="faq-section-title" style="margin-top:32px;">Financial Questions</h3>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-q">What currencies can I use to invest?<div class="faq-toggle">+</div></div>
        <p class="faq-a">We accept Bitcoin (BTC), Ethereum (ETH), Litecoin (LTC), Tether (USDT), Dogecoin (DOGE), Tron (TRX), Dash, and Ripple (XRP).</p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-q">How long does a deposit take to credit?<div class="faq-toggle">+</div></div>
        <p class="faq-a">After blockchain confirmation, all deposited funds are credited to your account within approximately 2 minutes.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-q">How many active investments can I have?<div class="faq-toggle">+</div></div>
        <p class="faq-a">The number of active investments you can hold simultaneously is unlimited. You may invest in multiple plans at the same time.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-q">How do I make a deposit?<div class="faq-toggle">+</div></div>
        <p class="faq-a">Log into your account, go to the Deposit section, select your cryptocurrency, copy the wallet address shown, and send your funds from your external wallet. Your balance updates automatically after confirmation.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-q">How quickly are withdrawal requests processed?<div class="faq-toggle">+</div></div>
        <p class="faq-a">Withdrawal requests are submitted instantly. The time for the funds to appear in your external wallet depends on blockchain network load, typically 10–60 minutes.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-q">Are there withdrawal fees?<div class="faq-toggle">+</div></div>
        <p class="faq-a">AuravexCapital charges no platform withdrawal fee. Standard blockchain network fees may apply depending on the network you use for the transaction.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-q">What is the referral program?<div class="faq-toggle">+</div></div>
        <p class="faq-a">Our three-level referral program pays 5% commission on each level. When someone you refer invests, you earn 5% of their investment — and if they refer others, you earn on those levels too.</p>
      </div>

    </div>

